  "behavior": [
    "BE99F0 captures current node, its+20 budget address and+8 reader, then invokes existing completeBF02A0/current stream slot38 without validating count/budget.",
    "B72710 bit-copies stacked float to mesh+C. B73270 captures signed/wrapping count destination, then performs four current source-word loads and destination stores in order, incrementing current count after stores. No physical four-slot bounds check or memcpy snapshot is introduced.",
    "B93710 reads unsigned count through BE99F0. Before each record it reads currentCE4ADC andCE4970, then replaces local words by direct FSTP32 from two BE99D0 reads, then reads twoBE9A00 DWORDs and appends. Each scalar rereads current handle/node; earlier appends survive failure.",
    "B93590/B935C0 consume exactly four/six BE99D0 values, each FSTP ST0. No extra float memory store, publication, child skip/detach or early EOF guard.",
    "B73D50 delegates actual mesh+B0 to existing4CDC20 deep-copy vector append with the same raw string-pool publication, shutdown gate and lifetime. Existing NativeStringStorage returning-getter failure boundary remains noexcept.",
    "B93F90 loops on current node+20. BEA010 fills local8h; its returned pointer is passed to append. Completed-local state0 precedes append. Capture local data before state-1; current length+1 and current pool govern its normal return. On failure only a completed local name is owned; prior appended names remain. Secondary cleanup exception terminates."
  ],
